	"name": "Star Rating",
	"library": "thingtime",
	"category": "data-display",
	"description": "Five-star rating row in the Thingtime style — the filled count is arg-driven through a calc-clipped overlay, so fractional scores like 3.5 fill half a star in the tone color. Interactive controls and editable values; saves private Things through an Action.",
